domain ADR0030B3LocalVerification:
  description "Verify the local V3 semantic asset and compiler boundary implementation."

problem P1:
  |
    Accepted ADR-0030 B3 requires qualified V3 character-definition and V4
    compiler boundaries before durable migration or provider orchestration begins.

evidence E_IMPLEMENTATION:
  |
    packages/shared/src/character-definition-v3.ts adds CharacterDefinitionV3,
    selector-required action norms, selector-free conscious guidance, registered
    mechanical conflict fallback and receipt, qualified compiler capabilities,
    separate typed deferred values, CharacterBattleCompilerInputsV4,
    BattleCharacterAssetBindingV4 and character_generation_v3 provenance.

evidence E_BOUNDARY:
  |
    Existing CharacterDefinitionV2, CharacterBattleCompilerInputsV3 and
    BattleCharacterAssetBindingV3 implementations were not changed. The new module
    contains no database, provider, deployment, pointer, policy or production code.

evidence E_TESTS:
  |
    packages/shared/src/character-definition-v3.test.ts verifies V2 readability,
    V3 selector enforcement, guidance/mechanics separation, registered fallback
    validation and legal ordering receipt, optional versus required deferral,
    deferred-value separation, V4 tuple closure and V3 provenance rejection rules.
    The focused invocation ran all 334 shared tests with zero failures.

evidence E_GATES:
  |
    npm test passed shared 334, backend 353, frontend 20, deployment 3 and release
    5 tests. npm run typecheck passed every workspace. npm run build passed with
    only the existing Vite chunk-size advisory. npm run static:jscpd passed.
    Lizard 1.23.0 checked 189 files and 3277 functions within all configured
    regression ceilings: complexity 116/121, length 67/67 and parameters 5/5.

premise LIMIT:
  |
    These local results establish contract behavior with deterministic fixtures.
    They do not establish migration persistence, provider semantic quality,
    production compatibility, deployment, activation or restoration of eight assets.

decision D1 based_on P1, E_IMPLEMENTATION, E_BOUNDARY, E_TESTS, E_GATES, LIMIT:
  |
    Treat B3 as locally verified and permit B4 durable attempt and preservation
    implementation to become the next plan gate. Preserve all external and later
    activation boundaries.
